ss/text declares process_text as the entry handler.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":7,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"principal-verified-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The route binds the caller to the verified user dependency, and the same user is passed into authorization and the write operation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":8,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"resource-selected-collection","kind":"binding","statement":"The protected collection target is the caller-supplied form_data.collection_name when present.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"caller-side-write-check","kind":"control","statement":"For a supplied collection name, the route invokes _validate_collection_access with access_type='write' before proceeding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":18}]},{"id":"shared-validator-delegation","kind":"control","statement":"The route-level validator delegates the requested collection set and write access type to filter_accessible_collections, then computes denied names and raises HTTP 403 when any are denied.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":31,"endLine":44}]},{"id":"existing-kb-write-policy","kind":"control","statement":"For non-admins, an ordinary collection name that is an existing knowledge base is validated through Knowledges.check_access_by_user_id using the requested access_type; the non-KB fallback applies only when no knowledge base exists.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":22,"endLine":25},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"nonadmin-policy-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The decisive scenario condition is a non-admin caller selecting an existing knowledge-base collection without the required write permission; the source policy's write check therefore does not add that name to the allowed set.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":10,"endLine":12},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"text-write-sink","kind":"effect","statement":"The text becomes a Document and is passed with the selected collection_name to save_docs_to_vector_db, the vector-database write sink, only after authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":19,"endLine":28}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2929,"output":1068,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":49472.6807,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T12:56:30.188Z"}}
